From 960569ba49bd27f44829ce74d73640216e1fe307 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: anyingiit <49945850+anyingiit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 20:07:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Write the SVG transparency group only when the SVG uses
 transparency (#2232)

Assisted-by: Claude Code
---
 CHANGELOG.md                   |  1 +
 src/Image/Svg.php              | 27 +++++++++++++++++++
 src/Writer/FormWriter.php      | 11 +++++++-
 tests/Issues/Issue2232Test.php | 48 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 86 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 tests/Issues/Issue2232Test.php

diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index c9840f3..030f4e4 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -18,6 +18,7 @@ Bugfixes
 * Conditional calls to functions removed in PHP 8.5
 * Fixed undefined array key warning when ending a multi-column layout (#2214)
 * Fixed division by zero error with invalid (<= 0>) `@page` `size` values, allowed standard values such as `size: A4` (#2101)
+* SVG images are only written with a transparency group when they use transparency, so content painted after an opaque SVG is no longer lost when printing on macOS (#2232)
 
 mPDF 8.2.x
 ===========================
